              "id": "t1",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "bf_emma",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "Thanks for coming to this demonstration of our modular storage system. Each cabinet can be assembled with a single tool, which is included in every box. The shelves are sold separately so you can order just the number you need. We've brought two sizes for you to try today. Before placing an order, I suggest taking a measurement card from the sample table. It shows how much clearance is needed for the doors to open fully.",
              "translationJa": "組み合わせ式収納システムの実演にお越しいただきありがとうございます。棚本体は箱に入っている工具1本で組み立てられます。棚板は別売りなので、必要な枚数だけ注文できます。本日はお試しいただくために2サイズを持ってきました。ご注文の前に、見本台から寸法カードを取ることをお勧めします。扉を完全に開けるのに必要な空き寸法が載っています。",
