          "setting": "家具店の記念セールの広告",
          "passages": [
            {
              "id": "t1",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "bf_emma",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "Is your living room ready for the holidays? Fairbrook Furniture is celebrating twenty-five years in business with our biggest sale ever. All sofas and armchairs are thirty percent off through Sunday. And delivery is free on any order over five hundred dollars.",
              "translationJa": "リビングの休暇シーズンの準備はできていますか。フェアブルック家具は創業25周年を記念して、過去最大のセールを開催中です。ソファとひじ掛け椅子はすべて日曜日まで30パーセント引き。さらに、500ドルを超えるご注文は配送無料です。",
              "pauseAfterMs": 460
            },
            {
              "id": "t2",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "bf_emma",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "Not sure what will fit your space? Bring a photo of your room and its measurements, and our designers will help you choose.",
              "translationJa": "お部屋に何が合うかわからない方は、お部屋の写真と寸法をお持ちください。当店のデザイナーが選ぶお手伝いをします。",
              "pauseAfterMs": 460
            },
            {
              "id": "t3",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "bf_emma",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "Our showroom on Pike Avenue is open until nine every night this week. Believe me, you won't see prices like these again this year.",
              "translationJa": "パイク通りのショールームは今週、毎晩9時まで営業しています。本当に、今年はもうこんな値段は見られませんよ。",
              "pauseAfterMs": 460
            }
          ],
