          "setting": "料理講習の開講案内〔図表〕",
          "passages": [
            {
              "id": "t1",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "bf_emma",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "Good morning. This is an update for participants in today's cooking classes. The ovens in Oak Kitchen are being tested, so Quick Breads will meet in the room normally used by Fresh Pasta. Quick Breads still starts at nine and will finish by ten. The pasta class will start thirty minutes later than listed, in its usual room. All participants should collect a clean apron from the welcome desk before entering a kitchen. There is a bowl by each kitchen door where you can leave your name badge when you finish.",
              "translationJa": "おはようございます。今日の料理講習の参加者に変更のお知らせです。オーク調理室のオーブンを点検中のため、クイックブレッドは生パスタが普段使う教室で行います。クイックブレッドは予定どおり9時に始まり、10時までに終わります。パスタの講習は通常の教室で、表より30分遅く始まります。参加者全員、調理室に入る前に案内受付で清潔なエプロンを受け取ってください。各調理室のドア脇にボウルがありますので、終了後に名札を入れてください。",
              "pauseAfterMs": 460
            }
          ],
