              "spokenText": "This is the driver of the Blue bus to Skyfen Airport. Passengers for the international terminal, please note that the Silver service is cancelled this morning. Please stay here at Civic Square and take the next service that stops at both terminals. Your ticket will still be valid. If you're on this bus for the domestic terminal, you may remain on board. For safety, please put large suitcases in the luggage compartment before we leave.",
              "translationJa": "スカイフェン空港行きブルー便の運転手です。国際線ターミナルへ向かうお客様、今朝のシルバー便は運休です。市民広場でお待ちいただき、次の両ターミナルに止まる便にご乗車ください。お持ちの切符はそのまま使えます。このバスで国内線ターミナルへ向かうお客様は、そのままご乗車ください。安全のため、大きなスーツケースは出発前に荷物室にお入れください。",
