              "speakerId": "bm_fable",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "Passengers travelling with bicycles should board the last carriage. We apologize for any inconvenience.",
              "translationJa": "自転車をお持ちのお客様は最後尾の車両にご乗車ください。ご迷惑をおかけして申し訳ございません。",
