              "text": "To: Customer Relations, Brightwater Ferries\nFrom: Thomas Ekland\nDate: June 9\nSubject: Bicycle reservations\nI live on Linden Island and have been riding the new ferry to my office in Port Avalon every weekday since it began. I take the earliest departure, and the shorter trip has made a real difference. I bought a monthly pass, which has also saved me money.\nHowever, I bring my bicycle every day, and I have twice been unable to reserve a space because all ten were taken. Since many passengers on the early ferries seem to be cyclists, would you consider increasing bicycle space on those trips? On days when I can't reserve a space, I have to take the 10:00 A.M. departure, which makes me late for work.\nThomas Ekland",
