              "text": "Call for volunteers\nThe Kettlewick Design Fair needs three people to welcome exhibitors at the service entrance. Volunteers will check names against a list and hand out badges between seven and nine. A ten-minute briefing will take place before the doors open. To help, contact the event office by Wednesday.",
